  "title": "Newfoundland-Style Pea Soup",
  "description": "This tasty pea soup of salted meat, yellow split peas, carrots, and turnips is made in the traditional Newfoundland style for a satisfying meal.",
  "authors": [
    "Allrecipes Member"
  ],
